<c>must </c><00:00:01.114><c>happen </c><00:00:01.115><c>before </c><00:00:01.116><c>effects </c><00:00:01.117><c>third </c><00:00:01.118><c>a  </c><00:00:01.119><c>single </c><00:00:01.120><c>event </c><00:00:01.121><c>might </c><00:00:01.122><c>have </c><00:00:01.123><c>more </c><00:00:01.124><c>than </c><00:00:01.125><c>one  </c><00:00:01.126><c>cause </c><00:00:01.127><c>or </c><00:00:01.128><c>more </c><00:00:01.129><c>than </c><00:00:01.130><c>one </c><00:00:01.131><c>effect </c><00:00:01.132><c>and </c><00:00:01.133><c>some  </c><00:00:01.134><c>causes </c><00:00:01.135><c>and </c><00:00:01.136><c>effects </c><00:00:01.137><c>may </c><00:00:01.138><c>be </c><00:00:01.139><c>more </c><00:00:01.140><c>important  </c><00:00:01.141><c>than </c><00:00:01.142><c>others  </c><00:00:01.143><c>fourth </c><00:00:01.144><c>events </c><00:00:01.145><c>that </c><00:00:01.146><c>happen </c><00:00:01.147><c>near </c><00:00:01.148><c>to </c><00:00:01.149><c>each  </c><00:00:01.150><c>other </c><00:00:01.151><c>in </c><00:00:01.152><c>time </c><00:00:01.153><c>or </c><00:00:01.154><c>space </c><00:00:01.155><c>aren't  </c><00:00:01.156><c>necessarily </c><00:00:01.157><c>related </c><00:00:01.158><c>by </c><00:00:01.159><c>a </c><00:00:01.160><c>cause </c><00:00:01.161><c>and  </c><00:00:01.162><c>effect </c><00:00:01.163><c>relationship </c><00:00:01.164><c>coincidences </c><00:00:01.165><c>happen  </c><00:00:01.166><c>and </c><00:00:01.167><c>lastly </c><00:00:01.168><c>causes </c><00:00:01.169><c>may </c><00:00:01.170><c>have </c><00:00:01.171><c>both </c><00:00:01.172><c>short  </c><00:00:01.173><c>and </c><00:00:01.174><c>long-term </c><00:00:01.175><c>effects </c><00:00:01.176><c>immediate </c><00:00:01.177><c>results  </c><00:00:01.178><c>and </c><00:00:01.179><c>downstream </c><00:00:01.180><c>impacts </c><00:00:01.181><c>that </c><00:00:01.182><c>go </c><00:00:01.183><c>far  </c><00:00:01.184><c>beyond </c><00:00:01.185><c>the </c><00:00:01.186><c>time </c><00:00:01.